, "change_log": "v1.0.14 \u2014 Chopping Update\nNew Arena \u2014 Chopping\n\nSlice and chop your way to victory in a brand-new arena!\nCut off arms, heads, and more with your sword or axe.\nAvailable from your Watch \u2192 Arcade Mode \u2192 Chopping.\n\nWeekly Challenge \u2014 Intercept\n\nHit a ball that isn't targeting you \u2014 20 times this week.\n(Step into a hit meant for someone else.)\nReward: Redirect Orb\n\nCommunity Credit\nHuge shoutout to @The Roaring Knight, whose original suggestion inspired Redirect! Unlock it through this week\u2019s challenge!\n\n\nNew Blade \u2014 Razor Carver\n\nA fast, sharp blade for quick strikes.\nNow in the shop in 3 colors!\n\n\nNew Cosmetic Set \u2014 Cyber Ninja (White)\n\nSuit up in sleek white-and-blue armor, complete with a glowing red visor.\n\n\nAll-Time Quest Board\n\nCheck your Level progress any time on the new All-time Quest Board,\nright next to the Weekly Challenge board.\nSee how close you are to your next hat reward!\n\nImprovements\n\nReady Room\n\n* Just standing in the Ready Room doesn't queue you for a match anymore.\n* Use your Watch to turn the light green, to join the next match.\n\nDeath Physics\n\n* Defeated players now fall and tumble with fun new physics, while their outfits stay properly attached.\n* You'll now see who defeated you on the respawn screen.\n\nCrafting Table\n\n* New sparkly effects when you drop items or place orbs.\n* Your blade now flies back to your hand with a cool animation.\n\nFrogCam\n\n* Better camera position for third-person and portrait videos.", "created_date": 1787894619, "id": "1700385978754002", "version": "1.0.14b", "version_code": 178, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application